  "content": "<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">详细的描述你的需求、约束边界、期待效果、希望实现效果。你说的越详细，AI实现的效果越好。目前AI做不到一句话写一个APP网站。所以别偷懒。</h1>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">图片是我在写数独网站的时候发现的一些小技巧。下面的内容完全可以创建一个doc的文档，然后用让AI阅读。比如这样：</h2>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/j61cvib74m_img1.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>然后，每一次输入需求的时候，用专属命令约束他。比如：</div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">功能开发</h3>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>@task 添加主题切换功能\n</span>@docs \n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>doc</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>开发规范</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">md</span><span>#</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">UI</span><span>要求\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>doc</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">CHANGELOG</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">md</span><span>\n</span>@requirement\n请添加深色主题支持，并：\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">1.</span><span> 符合</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">UI</span><span>设计规范\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">2.</span><span> 更新文档和</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">CHANGELOG</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">3.</span><span> 添加必要的测试</span></code></div></pre>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">Bug修复</h3>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>@task 修复移动端显示问题\n</span>@docs \n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>doc</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>开发规范</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">md</span><span>#</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">UI</span><span>要求\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>doc</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">CHANGELOG</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">md</span><span>\n</span>@requirement\n<span>请修复移动端</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">UI</span><span>显示异常，并：\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">1.</span><span> 确保响应式设计\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">2.</span><span> 更新</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">CHANGELOG</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">3.</span><span> 测试各种屏幕尺寸</span></code></div></pre>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">下面是我创建的所有MD文档分享出来。</h2>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">开发检查清单</h1>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">修改前检查</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 已阅读相关文档规范</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 修改符合目录结构规范</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 修改符合代码规范</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 修改符合命名规范</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 确认是否需要更新文档</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">修改中检查</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 代码符合 TypeScript 规范</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 组件符合 React 规范</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 状态管理符合规范</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> UI 符合设计规范</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 已添加必要的注释</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">修改后检查</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 更新了 CHANGELOG.md</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 记录了所有改动</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 标注了版本号</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 更新了相关文档</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 添加了必要的测试</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">提交信息模板</h2>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">类型</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> 简短描述\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span> 修改内容：\n</span><span>  </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">1.</span><span> \n</span><span>  </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">2.</span><span> \n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span> 相关文档：\n</span><span>  </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span> 开发规范</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">md</span><span>\n</span><span>  </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">CHANGELOG</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">md</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span> 检查项：\n</span><span>  </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span> 符合代码规范\n</span><span>  </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span> 更新了文档\n</span><span>  </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span> 添加了测试</span></code></div></pre>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">开发工作流程</h1>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">1. 任务开始前</h2>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>@task </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span>任务描述</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span>\n</span><span>@docs </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span>相关文档列表</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span>\n</span><span>@requirement </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span>具体要求</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span></code></div></pre>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">2. 文档检查</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>查看开发规范.md中相关规范</li>\n<li>检查是否需要更新文档</li>\n<li>确认修改是否符合规范</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">3. 修改执行</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>遵循代码规范进行修改</li>\n<li>添加必要的注释和文档</li>\n<li>确保代码质量</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">4. 文档更新</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>更新 CHANGELOG.md</li>\n<li>更新相关文档</li>\n<li>完成检查清单</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">5. 提交规范</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用规范的提交信息</li>\n<li>标注相关文档</li>\n<li>确认所有检查项</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">示例</h2>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>@task 添加键盘输入功能\n</span>@docs \n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>doc</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>开发规范</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">md</span><span>#交互功能\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">-</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>doc</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">CHANGELOG</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">md</span><span>\n</span>@requirement\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">1.</span><span> 符合交互功能规范\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">2.</span><span> 更新 </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">CHANGELOG</span><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">3.</span><span> 完成检查清单</span></code></div></pre>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">数独游戏开发规范</h1>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">1. 项目结构规范</h2>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">1.1 目录结构</h3>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing